 "meta": {
  "id": "tap-2026-10-09",
  "title": "TAP — Talent Accelerator Program",
  "intent": "Explain how the TAP staffing-plus-training model works, where the money comes from, and the open question about the ratio.",
  "canvas": [
   1280,
   720
  ],
  "source": {
   "kind": "wispr-flow",
   "meeting_id": "5106b366-0e5e-4a5d-9c8a-34cc7e9b2ccd",
   "file": "source/tap-2026-10-09.txt",
   "speaker_reliable": false
  }
 },
 "spans": [
  {
   "id": "S0",
   "quote": "And I call it TAP, Talent Accelerator Program."
  },
  {
   "id": "S1",
   "quote": "a client picks 6 to 8 employees to put into the program for upskilling"
  },
  {
   "id": "S2",
   "quote": "We match 50/50, and we put new hires into this program with the client."
  },
  {
   "id": "S3",
   "quote": "We come up with a set of prerequisite knowledge."
  },
  {
   "id": "S4",
   "quote": "Our people are at the same level their people are at."
  },
  {
   "id": "S5",
   "quote": "maybe we have 16 people in a group, in a cohort. We train them at no cost to the client."
  },
  {
   "id": "S6",
   "quote": "keep our 8 people on staff at a billable rate per hour for a minimum of a year"
  },
  {
   "id": "S7",
   "quote": "times 8 people times 40 hours a week times 50 weeks a year"
  },
  {
   "id": "S8",
   "quote": "that coach might be available an hour a day for 5 days a week, and then after a month they might be available 3 days a week an hour a day, and after another month they might be available 1 hour a day for a month. We slowly cut that coach back."
  },
  {
   "id": "S9",
   "quote": "they have the right to hire them direct"
  },
  {
   "id": "S10",
   "quote": "they can dismiss them and say we no longer need them"
  },
  {
   "id": "S11",
   "quote": "they could continue with us at an hourly rate for those same people, only it's probably a higher hourly rate"
  },
  {
   "id": "S12",
   "quote": "$25 per person times 40 hours times 8 people times 50 weeks. So that's about $400,000 profit in one cohort."
  },
  {
   "id": "S12b",
   "quote": "If we were making $25 per person per hour profit margin"
  },
  {
   "id": "S13",
   "quote": "we could run 10 cohorts in a year"
  },
  {
   "id": "S14",
   "quote": "If all you do is get staffing from another company, they're not going to coach your people. And if all you do is buy training, you're only going to upgrade your own people."
  },
  {
   "id": "S15",
   "quote": "I just feel like the ratio of eight to eight, like a one-to-one ratio, is too much."
  },
  {
   "id": "S16",
   "quote": "I believe that like two to four is the most effective in the short term if you're training like eight people"
  }
 ],
